(property "Description" "Manufacturer X05A10HXX p2 A2, ECN-P-2026011502 dated2026-01-15. Pin1 is left in standard top view; the native part is rotated180deg and moved2.5mm toward -Y so existing world signal positions and exact1..6 nets are retained. Signals0.3x0.8mm at0.5pitch, anchors0.4x0.8mm at+/-2.3mm; signal/anchor rows2.5mm apart. 0.3mm dual-contact FPC,0.5A/50V,closed height1.0+/-0.1mm,6pin open actuator1.55mm. FPC entry changes to -Y; actual FT01C folded tails, latch access, screw-head clearance and maximum mounted Z are not signed off. Procurement must verify A2 dimensions; mixed older drawing revisions are not accepted. No contact net is grounded/relabelled to fake fit." (at 0 0 0) (layer "F.Fab") (hide yes) (uuid "a4ea6f2c-b8c2-5cd8-b295-d68bc1b942d9") (effects (font (size 1 1))))
